Compile a ring machine that swaps pairs of symbols to a cyclic tag system, \
for a tape of 4 cells:\
\>", "ExampleText",
 CellID->679572274,ExpressionUUID->"ec5d7672-9312-4074-8fcc-eccfc395248f"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

